<title>USA: Fortress Group Inc Q3 pro forma shr rises.</title>
<headline>Fortress Group Inc Q3 pro forma shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share amounts)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   September 30,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net revenues			   $   81,995	  $  54,364</p>
<p>   Net income				  3,586		1,648</p>
<p> Net Income per share:			0.30		 0.17</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding			  11,764,375	  9,413,181</p>
<p>							Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>							   September 30,</p>
<p>							   1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net revenues				    $ 198,162 $  145,033</p>
<p>   Net income					  7,413	4,008</p>
<p>   Net Income per share:			    0.70	 0.42</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>   outstanding				  10,513,943  9,413,181</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are pro forma to reflect adjustments for the acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
